      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Users should be able to submit a long URL and receive a shortened version\n2. Users can optionally provide a custom alias and/or expiration for the shortened URL\n3. Users should be able to access the original URL by using the shortened URL",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to submit a long URL and receive a shortened version\n2. Users can optionally provide a custom alias and/or expiration for the shortened URL\n3. Users should be able to access the original URL by using the shortened URL",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 69
    },
